<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90718" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προφυλ-άσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προφύλ-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>keep guard before</i> a place or
			house, c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Ap.</u>
					538
				</span></i>
			 (in 
				Ep.
			 imper. form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προφύλαχθε</span>,
			for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προφυλάσσετε</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.7.14
			</span></i>: c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Hier.</u>
				6.10
			</span></i>: abs., <i>to be on guard, keep a look-out</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν προφυλάσσουσαν</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέα</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ἐπὶ Σκιάθῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.92
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				7.179
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1146
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.93
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>to be on one's guard, take precautions</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεφυλάξατο ὅσα ἐδύνατο μάλιστα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.185
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.38
			</span></i>: c. acc., <i>to be on one's guard</i> or <i>take
				precautions against</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.176
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				9.99
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.3.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.4.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later 
				Act.
			 is used like
			
				Med.
			, <i>take precautions against</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τοῦ σώματος κινήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.129a
				</span></i>
			.</div>
